{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:53:09+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:53:09+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Xior Student Housing NV","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Residential","country":"Belgium","city":"Antwerp","website":"https://www.xior.be","employees":252,"summary":"Xior Student Housing NV is the first Belgian public regulated real estate company (RREC) specializing in the student housing segment in Belgium, the Netherlands, Spain, Portugal, Germany, Poland, Denmark and Sweden. Within this property segment, Xior Student Housing offers a variety of accommodation, ranging from rooms with shared facilities to en-suite rooms and fully equipped studios. Since 2007, as owner-operator, Xior Student Housing has built high-quality, reliable student accommodation for students looking for the ideal place to study, live and relax. Xior Student Housing NV was incorporated in 2014 in Belgium.","exchange":"Brussels","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Xior Student Housing NV est la première société immobilière publique réglementée (RREC) belge spécialisée dans le secteur du logement étudiant en Belgique, aux Pays-Bas, en Espagne, au Portugal, en Allemagne, en Pologne, au Danemark et en Suède. Dans ce segment de l'immobilier, Xior Student Housing propose une variété d'hébergements, allant des chambres avec des installations communes aux chambres avec salle de bains privative et des studios entièrement équipés. Depuis 2007, en tant que propriétaire-exploitant, Xior Student Housing a construit un logement étudiant de haute qualité et fiable pour les étudiants à la recherche de l'endroit idéal pour étudier, vivre et se détendre."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1134690816,"shares_outstanding":46695094,"trailing_pe":13.885714,"forward_pe":10.238045,"price_to_book":0.63896924,"ev_to_ebitda":23.513,"ev_to_revenue":12.125,"dividend